{
  "title": "Hearty Portuguese Chwinamul Salad",
  "description": "A briny, shattering salad that combines fresh chwinamul with crisp vegetables and a nutty, paleo-friendly vinaigrette, perfect for a solo dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Portuguese",
  "diet": [
    "paleo",
