      "amount": "1 tsp"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Wash and dry the chwinamul, then roughly chop and place in a large bowl.",
    "Add sliced cucumber, halved cherry tomatoes, toasted pine nuts, chopped walnuts, and toasted almonds to the bowl.",
    "In a small bowl whisk the egg yolk, then gradually whisk in olive oil until the mixture emulsifies into a pale sauce.",
    "Stir in lemon juice, Dijon mustard, minced garlic, salt, pepper, and dried oregano to the sauce until well combined.",
    "Pour the vinaigrette over the salad and toss gently to coat all ingredients evenly.",
    "Serve immediately, allowing the briny flavors to shine in each bite."
  ],
